      "content": "i get that, but i'm just talking about a supplement, not a prescription drug. it's just vitamin c. i've heard people take massive amounts for \"mega-dosing\" to detox. if i just take it with plenty of water, wouldn't the water just flush out any extra stuff before it becomes a problem? it seems way safer than the pain i'm in right now.",
